        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;To-do list · C4 component view of the API (as built)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CHG-0001 · 2026-11-13&lt;br&gt;REQ-AUTH-001..005, REQ-ISO-001, REQ-TODO-001..007, REQ-LIST-001..003, NFR-007" style="text;harness=title;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
