        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Citations (as built)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;RequestIdFilter registered ahead of the security chain (order -200, REQUEST and ERROR dispatch): api/src/main/java/app/todo/config/WebConfig.java:L18-L27; request id and one log line per request: api/src/main/java/app/todo/common/RequestIdFilter.java:L18-L21, L44-L72.&lt;br&gt;Security chain order and 401 entry point: api/src/main/java/app/todo/config/SecurityConfig.java:L52-L60.&lt;br&gt;Cookie resolved via SessionService.resolve, CurrentUser set as principal: api/src/main/java/app/todo/auth/SessionCookieAuthenticationFilter.java:L33-L54.&lt;br&gt;AuthController operations: api/src/main/java/app/todo/auth/AuthController.java:L34-L59; AuthService holds UserRepository and SessionService: AuthService.java:L18-L28 (users used at L59, L88, L102).&lt;br&gt;SessionService holds only SessionRepository (SHA-256 token hash, 8 h): api/src/main/java/app/todo/auth/SessionService.java:L16-L32, L64-L70.&lt;br&gt;TodoController reads CurrentUser (app.todo.auth.api) with @AuthenticationPrincipal: api/src/main/java/app/todo/todo/TodoController.java:L3, L24-L74; TodoService: TodoService.java:L17-L86.&lt;br&gt;Owner-scoped repository contract: api/src/main/java/app/todo/todo/TodoRepository.java:L11-L32.&lt;br&gt;Single DataSource, pool of 1: api/src/main/java/app/todo/config/DatabaseConfig.java:L19-L39." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="960" width="1000" height="230" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;harness=legend;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
